POINTER: Swimming mechanics (submerged buoyancy, drag, Space-to-ascent, gentle sink) are implemented in the same controller — relevant if extending gameplay (POINTER: controls.ts, SWIM_UP_SPEED/SWIM_SINK_SPEED/WATER_DRAG constants)
POINTER: Sprint multiplier (SPRINT = 1.6) and step audio accumulator (stepAccum) exist — relevant for extending movement/audio (POINTER: controls.ts)
POINTER: Chunk streaming is driven from the controller via `this.renderer.update(this.x, this.z)` — the renderer is the load-bearing meshing/streaming component (POINTER: controls.ts, update loop)
