POINTER: The water simulation is event-driven and generational: it advances on fixed 0.2s steps, each step evaluates one generation of cells and defers the next. Horizontal spread is gated to below sea level to bound flooding. This is a well-hardened design that any extension (e.g. lava) would need to mirror. (water-sim.ts)
